Date: Thu, 4 Jan 2024 17:45:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 0575/1695] plat-stm32mp1: add function do_reset()

Add a new helper function do_reset() to handle the system reset
without dependency with PSCI function.

This patch is a preliminary step for STM32MP25 introduction.

The function do_reset() stops the secondary core and flush the
console before to execute the RCC function stm32_reset_system()
to execute the system reset.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git a114efca12801407e394be94ab68608ddbdbaad9 plat-stm32mp1: add function do_reset()]
